The files in this directory are derived from the official KiCad libraries
(https://gitlab.com/kicad/libraries/kicad-symbols and kicad-footprints, version 8.0.9):

* footprints/                vendored footprint files of the curated library's parts
* symbol_index.json.gz       symbol names, descriptions, default footprints, datasheet
                             links and pin tables (number, name, electrical type, unit)
* footprint_geom.json.gz     footprint names, pads and courtyards
* footprint_index.json       footprint names

